  "id": "grilled-tandoori-chicken-thighs",
  "name": "Grilled Tandoori Chicken Thighs",
  "subtitle": "Yogurt-marinated chicken with warm Indian spices",
  "description": "Chicken thighs are coated in a spiced yogurt marinade, rested, and grilled until browned and safely cooked through.",
